== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Dark Elf Enchanter, you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: Join the Spurned, and learn the ways of the Enchanter. Take this note to [[Camia V`Retta | Camia V'Retta]] at the Tower of the Spurned. She will help teach you the skills of the arcane.

Upon handing the note to [[Camia V`Retta]]:

: [[Camia V`Retta]] says, 'Greetings, and welcome to the Tower of the Spurned. I am Camia V'Retta, master enchantress. Here is your guild tunic, wear it with pride.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standings with [[The Spurned]] got better.
* Your faction standings with [[The Dead]] got worse.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Crimson Training Tunic*]]. Good luck, Enchanter!

